        "valueString": "Rash for 5 days: erythematous, slightly raised papules/thin plaques on both flexor forearms with some excoriations and a sharp T-shirt-line cutoff; a few similar papules on the anterior neck above the collar. No vesicles, crust, pustules, target lesions, or urticaria."
